; MyThuso — the whole zone, for importing into Cloudflare in one step.
;
; Captured from the live domains.co.za nameservers on 7 September 2026, before any change, so that
; moving the website does not take the mail with it. Everything below is unchanged from what is
; serving today EXCEPT the two website records, which move from the registrar's parking page
; (169.239.219.58) to the server the app is deployed on.
;
; The mail records must stay DNS-only in Cloudflare — grey cloud, never orange. Cloudflare proxies
; HTTP; it does not proxy SMTP or IMAP, and an orange cloud on mail.mythuso.co.za would stop mail reaching you.
;
; Verify after import:   dig +short mythuso.co.za  ->  154.66.198.238
;                        dig +short MX mythuso.co.za  ->  unchanged
;                        send yourself an email before you tell anyone the site is live.

$TTL 3600

; ---- the website: this is the only thing that changes ----
mythuso.co.za.                  IN  A      154.66.198.238
www.mythuso.co.za.              IN  A      154.66.198.238

; ---- mail: unchanged, and must remain so ----
mythuso.co.za.                  IN  MX     10 mx1.tld-mx.com.
mail.mythuso.co.za.             IN  A      169.239.218.78
webmail.mythuso.co.za.          IN  CNAME  mail.mythuso.co.za.
smtp.mythuso.co.za.             IN  CNAME  mail.mythuso.co.za.
imap.mythuso.co.za.             IN  CNAME  mail.mythuso.co.za.
pop.mythuso.co.za.              IN  CNAME  mail.mythuso.co.za.

; ---- mail authentication: lose any of these and your mail starts landing in spam ----
mythuso.co.za.                  IN  TXT    "v=spf1 +a:mail.mythuso.co.za +mx include:_spf.tld-mx.com ~all"
_dmarc.mythuso.co.za.           IN  TXT    "v=DMARC1; p=none;"
default._domainkey.mythuso.co.za. IN TXT   "v=DKIM1; k=rsa; p=MIIBIjANBgkqhkiG9w0BAQEFAAOCAQ8AMIIBCgKCAQEAs9k0jv5KaWb9SrLolBes4Ns7VxaYGETjEaPuDLbl258tUrMLMfgTrBeP+6w3lqUZGvuChP9eNfRQYkdRjoa96/Bznr87UZM+Gmh2C1G01h8aoZfuULUmvVQgWbJCW3ALcCcp21K7TRcKV2x3hPW2jSaS8sYlQOizvCGPTkAnjBN/bXkYX5Jmt9dLRv9u5Pbt0" "3RuOEuVax+BoTk8+O27r69msoiYgP33WwqemXAo50gqPqrdYXeLZQm6WzWHt+O8sncSFDKLmOBSgTK9/lTSPW0y6ZBxjl3KZlXoKGaVP7L9gesI7ZLjBXhL1Bm9pP5iRPLQE3SWugbZns1Q6KHPAQIDAQAB;"
